WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.950
You know how messy client onboarding gets.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:10.450
20 email threads, broken drive links, and finding out weeks later someone mistyped one digit in their ABN.

3
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.950
We built GatherGate to fix that.

4
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:22.650
You send one passwordless magic link. If your client mistypes a tax or bank number, deterministic checksums catch it right there before they even hit send.

5
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:31.250
Every upload is verified by its real file signature, then encrypted per record with AES-256-GCM on your own server.

6
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:39.050
On your side, preview decrypted files inline, hit A to approve and lock, and export a clean ZIP or signed webhook.

7
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:44.350
One self-hosted container, zero telemetry, MIT open source.

8
00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.250
GatherGate, client intake without the chase.
